{"v":4,"catch":"期待已久的《Super Volleyball》第二彈，競技玩法有趣！ ！","desc":"《POWER SPIKES》是「VIDEO SYSTEM」於1991年發行的運動遊戲。\n這是《Super Volleyball》的第二部，和前作一樣，操作簡單，但戰鬥更加深刻，包括定時攻擊和佯攻等技巧，以及遊戲中添加的新發球。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-10-10","genres":["運動","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/acb508a1cb6b2e83041c62930a3357c0cc99abb6901f4168863a6b6ed342d75f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34feb2a1412e066b3d26489aac70f538a73fc102a28eadc9e9d0298be165eef7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6edd4c097f33eb07950c4b0aed2d4a16183501a35c57078484ba06c816487779.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ce8a76c03c0c1ba2e4884404aa539a6c514d4cd376e2dc71ef13a2462cf17ce8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65f0cd0ce6772b752dedc87b420af1b253589479af631e3319f5d3ab1aefd2c6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/abd13011d000bfdd99ce6ebf9a4eb4ec654566a87001749e0f29416b12eb1900.jpg"],"titleId":"010083501fb9e000","dlc":[]}